  "scope": "0.10.1-claudegpt.20: stage 2 slice 1 of the Rust migration. Additive PTY host protocol services (welcome services.transcripts=1, svc/svc-result/svc-event, no protocol bump); rust/reframe-transcripts ports TranscriptIndex.list/readTranscriptInfo/latestTitle (no unsafe); the Rust host serves transcripts.list/info/times/title/invalidate/watch with a notify watcher and transcripts.changed events (dropped while no reframe is attached); the Node host serves the same with the TypeScript modules; conformance tests run the same transcript fixtures against both hosts; Electron uses the host service for Windows' own Claude folder when advertised and reads in-process otherwise (older hosts, WSL homes)",
